  "description": "A .NET reader and writer for Prusa's binary G-code (bgcode) container format: file header, block enumeration, per-block compression (deflate, heatshrink), MeatPack G-code encoding and decoding, CRC-32 checksums, the JSON metadata PrusaSlicer 3 writes, and whole-file conversion to and from ASCII G-code. Implemented from the published format specification; the reader is hardened against untrusted input, the writer cannot produce a file the reference implementation refuses.",
